          "block_label": "table",
          "block_content": "<table><tr><td>单词</td><td>音标</td><td>词性</td><td>词义</td><td>运用</td></tr><tr><td>beautiful</td><td>/ˈbjuːtɪfl/</td><td>adj.</td><td>美丽的</td><td>What a beautiful flower! 多美的一朵花啊! Linda has a beautiful doll. 琳达有一个漂亮的洋娃娃。</td></tr><tr><td>rainbow</td><td>/ˈreɪnbəʊ/</td><td>n.</td><td>彩虹</td><td>There is a rainbow in the sky. 天空中挂着一道彩虹。 Do you like the rainbow? 你喜欢那道彩虹吗?</td></tr><tr><td>shine</td><td>/ʃaɪn/</td><td>v.</td><td>照耀;闪耀</td><td>The sun shines through the window. 阳光透过窗户照耀进来。 It&#x27;s a beautiful morning and the sun is shining. 这是个迷人的早晨, 阳光照耀。</td></tr><tr><td>outside</td><td>/aʊtˈsaɪd/</td><td>adv. &amp; prep.</td><td>在外面</td><td>I can hear the dog barking outside. 我能听到外面的狗叫声。 Paul puts on the coat and walks outside. 保罗穿上大衣走了出去。</td></tr><tr><td>window</td><td>/ˈwɪndəʊ/</td><td>n.</td><td>窗户;橱窗</td><td>It&#x27;s cold outside. Can you close the window for me, please? 外面很冷。你能为我关窗吗? I do like the beautiful dress in the window. 我很喜欢橱窗里那条漂亮的连衣裙。</td></tr></table>",
